From 7cf7d6b16fe224540d0bdff1873d41d556369b61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Reck <jreck@google.com>
Date: Thu, 7 Aug 2025 16:50:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Crude DNG SDK 1.7.1 upgrade

This crudely hacks out JXL and XMP support that are
otherwise now required in order to avoid taking those dependencies
on pervious releases.

But it should otherwise work.

This change is a cherry-pick of ag/34978264. The resulting build errors
were fixed by adding [[maybe_unused]] to the functions in dng_jxl.h and
correcting format specifier for uint64 in dng_jpeg_image.cpp.

Bug: 412662901
Test: make && atest android.graphics.cts.BitmapFactoryTest
Test: atest CVE_2025_22423
(cherry picked from https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:0a1a1f2b2f86602b219abc6ad634f0f12eac043d)
Merged-In: I96e4f32d35694bdeb4e4ed124616557afaef6ee7

Change-Id: Ia0aea4a37fa7a4a87e383abfcfc3bce5118e5adf
